          <body>Rationale: Only properly packed cakes may ship. Source: UC14, UC15. Feature: FIN-FEAT-11. (Applies to FIN-REQ-23.1, FIN-REQ-23.2, FIN-REQ-23.3.)</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_vaZtm9eaygGWI3r90T2kms" name="FIN-REQ-23.2">
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_R95izWTG1E3s9nE_5jG_f3" name="FIN-REQ-23.3">
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_4X5FPbxph9y5QC8WCHXrJa" name="FIN-REQ-24.1">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_26As4BhfN1LAcF4jSecBIQ" annotatedElement="_4X5FPbxph9y5QC8WCHXrJa _iDNdmTTTX2AZFY2jwikr3q">
          <body>Rationale: Business rule for food safety and preservation. Source: UC14, UC15. Feature: FIN-FEAT-13. (Applies to FIN-REQ-24.1, FIN-REQ-24.2.)</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_iDNdmTTTX2AZFY2jwikr3q" name="FIN-REQ-24.2">
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_8zkGJBJzcOwzZt-QD3zq8F" name="FIN-REQ-25">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_u5TaEwun6fYidjTWdePieG" annotatedElement="_8zkGJBJzcOwzZt-QD3zq8F">
          <body>Rationale: Wrongly filled cases must be detected and reported while the line keeps running. Source: FC26. Feature: FIN-FEAT-12. (Applies to FIN-REQ-25.)</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_s1_-hQpt6EmcfxgsyREFg8" name="FIN-REQ-26.2">
