          <body>Rationale: Design decision: these discards are recorded for traceability. Source: FC21, FC26, UC14, UC15. Feature: FIN-FEAT-13. (Applies to FIN-REQ-26.2.)</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_f35Bvvh8wILzDHwB8Q7xgf" name="FIN-REQ-26.3">
